rootCauses.stockRule:
A plain click or drag start below the last row of an extended list puts anchor and caret on the last row. The only selected row afterwards is X, the list box's last clicked, LB_SETSEL or type-ahead row. Deletes, inserts, drag moves and navigation keys do not change X. Nothing is selected when X >= count.

